For your information:

Patchlevel 7 (the final patch for 3.0) is now firmly scheduled to
be released on January 30th.  The delay is due, mainly, to the need
to give the auxiliary teams (Mac, Amiga, and PC Overlay) ample time
to perfect their ports.

We are very grateful for bug reports posted here (and in ..games.bugs),
but please mail them also directly to nethack-bugs@linc.cis.upenn.edu.  
Some of us have (temporary) problems with their news feed.

Many of the bugs which are repeatedly being noticed and reported have
already been fixed, but no doubt many bugs still remain.  We need as 
much testing for bugs as we can get from you before January 30th.  Please
get into wizard or discovery modes and push the game around.

Have a happy new year.

For the development team,

-Izchak


